  "zh": "# 神舟二十四号载巴基斯坦航天员对接空间站，OpenAI发数学论文，GTA6代码泄露\n## 航天外交\n- **神舟二十四号 巴基斯坦航天员 空间站**：中国首次接待外籍航天员，标志空间站国际合作新阶段。\n- **巴基斯坦总理 感谢中国 空间站合作**：谢里夫称中国为兄弟，凸显中巴全天候战略互信。\n## AI前沿\n- **OpenAI 发布 九篇 数学 论文**：新数学工具或加速 AI 推理能力，学界高度关注。\n- **05后 女孩 用 AI 日入 四千元**：展示生成式 AI 低门槛变现，引发青年创业热议。\n## 游戏安全\n- **GTA6 核心 文件 泄露 AI 移植 PC**：黑客泄露后 AI 仅用数小时跑通 PC 版，显示模型逆向工程威胁。\n- **美国 国库 子域名 被 劫持 三美元**：仅需 3 美元即可接管财政子域，暴露供应链安全短板。\n## 产业金融\n- **大众 汽车 薪资 谈判 工人 抬棺 抗议**：德国车企劳资对抗升级，棺材抗议成舆论焦点。\n- **黄金 价格 大跌 银行 发布 风险 提示**：避险逻辑动摇，机构提示黄金不再绝对保值。",
  "en": "# Shenzhou‑24 docks with Pakistani astronaut; OpenAI drops nine math papers; GTA 6 code leaks, AI ports to PC in hours\n## Space & Diplomacy\n- **Shenzhou 24 Pakistani astronaut joins space station**: China hosts its first foreign astronaut, marking a new phase of international cooperation on the space station.\n- **Pakistan PM thanks China for space cooperation**: Prime Minister Shehbaz calls China a brother, underscoring the all‑weather strategic trust.\n## AI Frontier\n- **OpenAI releases nine math papers**: New math tools could accelerate AI reasoning, drawing intense academic attention.\n- **Gen‑Z girl earns $4k daily using AI**: Shows low‑barrier monetization of generative AI, sparking youth entrepreneurship buzz.\n## Gaming & Security\n- **GTA 6 core files leaked AI ports to PC**: After the leak, AI got the PC version running in hours, highlighting model reverse‑engineering risk.\n- **US Treasury subdomains hijacked for $3**: For just three dollars attackers seized fiscal subdomains, exposing supply‑chain security gaps.\n## Industry & Finance\n- **Volkswagen wage talks workers protest with coffins**: German auto labor dispute escalates, coffin protest becomes media focal point.\n- **Gold price plunges banks issue risk warnings**: Safe‑haven logic shaken, institutions warn gold is no longer an absolute store of value."
